From: thanhan92-f1 <thanhan92-f1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 08:42:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(payment-methods): add viet_qr, momo_atm and
 local_bank_redirect

- add PaymentMethodsRecord entries with neutral sprite icons
- build request bodies for real_time_payment/viet_qr, card_redirect/momo_atm
  and bank_redirect/local_bank_redirect without QR/redirect suffixes
- add VietQR presentation config to QRCodeDisplay
- add payment_methods_viet_qr, payment_methods_momo_atm and
  payment_methods_local_bank_redirect strings to all locales

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014p7hcqtGKsGWvEUtmq6YEC

